---
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content';
import Page from '../../layouts/Page.astro';
import Callout from '../../components/Callout.astro';
import CoffinCard from '../../components/CoffinCard.astro';
import { CONTACT } from '../../data/site';

const breadcrumbs = [{ name: 'Coffins', url: '/coffins/' }];

const coffins = (await getCollection('coffins')).sort(
  (a, b) => a.data.order - b.data.order
);

const ecoMaterials = ['Willow', 'Bamboo', 'Pandanus', 'Banana leaf', 'Cardboard', 'Shroud'];
const eco = coffins.filter((c) => ecoMaterials.includes(c.data.material));
const other = coffins.filter((c) => !ecoMaterials.includes(c.data.material));
---

<Page
  title="Coffins — Eco, Willow, Bamboo & Traditional | John Bald"
  heading="Coffins"
  description="The full Ecoffins range in Dunbar: willow, bamboo, pandanus, banana leaf and recycled cardboard, alongside traditional wooden coffins. Fully biodegradable options."
  standfirst="The full Ecoffins range, alongside traditional wooden coffins. Have a look before you come in, so it is not a decision made cold across a desk."
  breadcrumbs={breadcrumbs}
  wide={true}
>
  <div class="prose-jb">
    <p>
      Choosing a coffin is one of the few decisions in a funeral that is genuinely about
      taste rather than logistics, and it is the one families most often feel rushed
      through. These pages are here so you can think about it in your own time.
    </p>
    <p>
      We supply the complete range from <a href="https://www.ecoffins.co.uk/" rel="noopener">Ecoffins</a>,
      who have been making handwoven natural coffins for over twenty years, as well as
      conventional wooden coffins. Every coffin here is suitable for cremation as well as
      burial unless the page says otherwise.
    </p>
  </div>

  <h2 class="mt-14 font-serif text-3xl">Natural and eco coffins</h2>
  <p class="mt-3 max-w-2xl text-ink-soft">
    Handwoven from fast-growing renewable materials, or made from recycled board.
    No plastic, no metal, no screws and no staples.
  </p>

  <ul class="mt-8 grid gap-8 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
    {eco.map((coffin) => <CoffinCard coffin={coffin} />)}
  </ul>

  <h2 class="mt-16 font-serif text-3xl">Traditional coffins, urns and keepsakes</h2>

  <ul class="mt-8 grid gap-8 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
    {other.map((coffin) => <CoffinCard coffin={coffin} />)}
  </ul>

  <div class="prose-jb mt-16">
    <Callout tone="accent" title="How to order one">
      <p>
        Coffins are supplied through us rather than bought directly — Ecoffins sell only
        to funeral directors, which is true of every coffin maker in the UK. Tell us which
        one you would like and we will arrange it, usually within two working days.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-3">
        Telephone <a href={CONTACT.phoneHref} class="font-semibold">{CONTACT.phone}</a>{' '}
        or <a href="/contact/">send us a message</a> and we will tell you the cost of any
        coffin here, with no obligation.
      </p>
    </Callout>

    <h2>A few things worth knowing</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>Eco does not mean flimsy.</strong> Every coffin here is tested to carry
        safely and is used routinely for burial and cremation.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>You can use a natural coffin anywhere.</strong> You do not need a natural
        burial ground to choose willow or cardboard — they are perfectly usual in an
        ordinary cemetery or crematorium.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Price varies more than you would expect.</strong> Cardboard is the least
        expensive by some margin; solid hardwood the most. The woven coffins sit between.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>You may buy a coffin elsewhere.</strong> If you would rather source your
        own, or make one, we will use it. Just tell us, and we will check the dimensions
        with the crematorium or cemetery beforehand.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <p>
      <a href="/funeral-services/natural-burial/">More about natural burial</a> ·{' '}
      <a href="/funeral-costs/">What a funeral costs</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</Page>

<!--
  Photography: each coffin needs a real image before launch. Confirm with Ecoffins
  which trade images may be used publicly, and confirm indicative pricing the client
  is willing to publish — `indicativePrice` is null across the range until then.
-->
